  "sections": {
   "install": {
    "title": "Quick Start",
    "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">docker run -p 8080:8080 docker.stirlingpdf.com/stirlingtools/stirling-pdf\n</code></pre>\n<p>Then open: <a href=\"http://localhost:8080\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://localhost:8080</a></p>\n<p>For full installation options (including desktop and Kubernetes), see our <a href=\"https://docs.stirlingpdf.com/#documentation-guide\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Documentation Guide</a>.</p>",
    "truncated": false,
    "chars": 272
   },
   "usage": null,
   "features": {
    "title": "Key Capabilities",
    "html": "<ul>\n<li><strong>Everywhere you work</strong> - Desktop client, browser UI, and self-hosted server with a private API.</li>\n<li><strong>50+ PDF tools</strong> - Edit, merge, split, sign, redact, convert, OCR, compress, and more.</li>\n<li><strong>Automation &amp; workflows</strong> - No-code pipelines direct in UI with APIs to process millions of PDFs.</li>\n<li><strong>Enterprise‑grade</strong> - SSO, auditing, and flexible on‑prem deployments.</li>\n<li><strong>Developer platform</strong> - REST APIs available for nearly all tools to integrate into your existing systems.</li>\n<li><strong>Global UI</strong> - Interface available in 40+ languages.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>For a full feature list, see the docs: <strong><a href=\"https://docs.stirlingpdf.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.stirlingpdf.com</a></strong></p>",
    "truncated": false,
    "chars": 605
   }
